## 1. Hardware Design Setup (KiCad)

The custom flight controller board and schematics were designed using KiCad. 

To view, edit, or generate manufacturing files for the hardware:
1. Download and install the latest version of KiCad from the [official KiCad download page](https://www.kicad.org/download/).
2. Clone this repository to your local machine.
3. Open KiCad, click **File > Open Project**, and navigate to the `.kicad_pro` file inside the hardware directory.
4. Use the **Schematic Editor** to view the circuit design and the **PCB Editor** to inspect the board layout and 3D model.

